MiMo full-attention layers on GB10 (SM121), TP=2:
- split-KV grouped-head kernel for EAGLE/DFlash target VERIFY (SGLANG_MIMO_CUDA_VERIFY)
- FlashInfer FA2 paged prefill (SGLANG_MIMO_PREFILL_IMPL=flashinfer) with a grouped Triton
  fallback (SGLANG_MIMO_PREFILL_GROUPED) for prefixes >= SGLANG_MIMO_PREFILL_MIN_PREFIX
Applied after the recipe patches; the kernels live in mimo_cuda_verify.py / mimo_prefill_grouped.py.

